<title>MOROCCO: PRESS DIGEST - Morocco - Dec 14.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Morocco - Dec 14.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Moroccan press on Saturday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LE MATIN DU SAHARA</p>
<p>- U.S. and Morocco consolidate relations. (Story refers to recent visit of Crown Prince Sidi Mohammed to Washington where he met President Clinton).</p>
<p>- Former Moroccan prime minister Azeddine Laraki appointed secretary-general of Organisation of the Islamic Conference.</p>
<p>L'OPINION</p>
<p>- Western Sahara's capital Laayoun builds water project at cost of $71 million.</p>
<p>AL-MAGHRIB</p>
<p>- Parliament adopts Spanish-Moroccan cooperation accord.</p>
